# A chat handed to a fresh session on another model mid-way: the "Context handoff" line where it took over.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
project storefront shop
chat Ada claude:builtin-claude
say "Sketch the orders table"
settle 10
core handOff {"agentId":"$chat","provider":"claude","model":"claude-opus-5-5"}
settle 4
say "Carry on from there"
settle 12
front Ada
settle 2
snap context-handoff
